    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/58a942cefce98673d3896ea8408e7c19.avif?t=1748891433\" /></div><strong>My Cute Fuhrer</strong> \u2013 a satirical anti-war visual novel with a \u201cmatch3\u201d-type gameplay. This game does not contain non-tolerance, any symbols of any political organizations and anything like that. Only love and mutual understanding. <strong>Make Match3, not war \u2665</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the cute and shy <strong>Fuhrer</strong>. She loves making beautiful paintings and dreams of realizing her global plans. But she has no friends and no one takes her seriously. Fuhrer\u2019s main dream \u2013 is to meet a close and loving person\u2026 and to take over the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/d39b8c88f24bd6794fa47a6271a0e6db.poster.avif?t=1748891433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/d39b8c88f24bd6794fa47a6271a0e6db.webm?t=1748891433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend this evening in a <strong>company of cute girls</strong>. Use your charm to melt their <strong>hearts \u2665</strong> Classic gameplay and incredibly interesting story. <strong>You are a secret agent</strong>. The best secret agent. You are devilishly smart, talented and charming. Your main objective is to neutralize the Fuhrer, but can you really do this?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/0daab2794c4c8e0d86ec5ebeaca4fa2e.webp?t=1748891433\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anti-war love story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute girls in military uniforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unusual story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic gameplay: match3 and visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lofi hip hop by G374</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/0daab2794c4c8e0d86ec5ebeaca4fa2e.webp?t=1748891433\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/58a942cefce98673d3896ea8408e7c19.avif?t=1748891433\" /></div><strong>My Cute Fuhrer</strong> \u2013 a satirical anti-war visual novel with a \u201cmatch3\u201d-type gameplay. This game does not contain non-tolerance, any symbols of any political organizations and anything like that. Only love and mutual understanding. <strong>Make Match3, not war \u2665</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the cute and shy <strong>Fuhrer</strong>. She loves making beautiful paintings and dreams of realizing her global plans. But she has no friends and no one takes her seriously. Fuhrer\u2019s main dream \u2013 is to meet a close and loving person\u2026 and to take over the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/d39b8c88f24bd6794fa47a6271a0e6db.poster.avif?t=1748891433\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/d39b8c88f24bd6794fa47a6271a0e6db.webm?t=1748891433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend this evening in a <strong>company of cute girls</strong>. Use your charm to melt their <strong>hearts \u2665</strong> Classic gameplay and incredibly interesting story. <strong>You are a secret agent</strong>. The best secret agent. You are devilishly smart, talented and charming. Your main objective is to neutralize the Fuhrer, but can you really do this?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/0daab2794c4c8e0d86ec5ebeaca4fa2e.webp?t=1748891433\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anti-war love story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute girls in military uniforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unusual story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic gameplay: match3 and visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lofi hip hop by G374</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205960/extras/0daab2794c4c8e0d86ec5ebeaca4fa2e.webp?t=1748891433\" /></div></p>",
